por el local Druida bar&amp;drinks ha sido el premiado como mejor c&oacute;ctel, seguido del combinado del Pub Logos y en tercer lugar Do</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">nde Mar</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&iacute;a Jos</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&eacute;</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">. El premio a la originalidad lo ha conseguido el Pub Logos y el mejor sabor ha sido para el Passatge.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_7432.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">El jurado estaba compuesto por el presidente de &lsquo;Sumilleres de Castell&oacute;n y Provincia&rsquo;</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">, David Buch, </span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">por el teniente de alcalde de Dinamizaci&oacute;n E</span><span lang=\"IT\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">con</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&oacute;mica del Ayuntamiento de Onda, &Aacute;ngel Badenas Don&iacute;s, y Toni Cort</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&eacute;</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">s, campe&oacute;n de Cocteler&iacute;a de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Barmans de la Comunitat Valenciana (ABCV) 2017. </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_7441.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Los dos expertos han destacado el trabajo de elaboraci&oacute;n de las propuestas participantes. Adem&aacute;s han valorado muy positivamente la iniciativa de la ruta del c&oacute;ctel y el concurso, ya que es una manera &ldquo;de mejorar cada vez m&aacute;s, superarse en cada convocatoria&rdquo;.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG_7445.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Badenas&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">ha resaltado la gran experiencia y ha augurado que crecer&aacute; en locales y calidad en los pr&oacute;</span><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">ximos a</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&ntilde;</span><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; backgro