attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&iacute;a Jos</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&eacute;</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">, Pub Logos y El Patio Casual Bar. Con un tiempo de 7 minutos por c&oacute;ctel los &lsquo;barmans&rsquo; de Onda han demostrado sus habilidades y defendido su c&oacute;ctel elaborado especialmente para esta ruta. El jurado ha valorado la puesta en escena, el tiempo y calidad de realizaci&oacute;n, la presentaci&oacute;n y el sabor.</span></span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Hasta el d&iacute;a 25 de junio se pueden degustar los c&oacute;cteles tambi&eacute;n en Campus Espai d&rsquo;</span><span lang=\"PT\" style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Oci y</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;Colonial.<span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Una vez finalizada la Ruta, se otorgar</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&aacute; </span><span lang=\"IT\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">el premio del p</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&uacute;</span><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">blico al mejor c&oacute;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">ctel con las votaciones realizadas.</span></p>\n<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:8.85pt;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7431.jpg\" alt=\"img_7431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7432.jpg\" alt=\"img_7432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7433.jpg\" alt=\"img_7433\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7434.jpg\" alt=\"img_7434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7437.jpg\" alt=\"img_7437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7438.jpg\" alt=\"img_7438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7440.jpg\" alt=\"img_7440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7441.jpg\" alt=\"img_7441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7443.jpg\" alt=\"img_7443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/juratexpertsrutacoctel/img_7445.jpg\" alt=\"img_7445\" style=\"max